Package: violoop-rknn3-toolkit-lite
Version: 1.0.4
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: alex <liuhlightning@qq.com>
Section: python
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Description: RKNN3 Toolkit Lite aarch64 wheels (RK1820/RK1828/RK3572)
 Stages the RKNN3 Toolkit Lite Python wheels (cp311, cp312) under
 /opt/violoop/wheels for offline pip installation into application
 virtualenvs. RKNN3 Toolkit Lite is not published on PyPI, so this package
 is the distribution channel for the on-board (aarch64) Python runtime.
 .
 Install into a venv (pip auto-selects the wheel matching the venv's Python):
   pip install --no-index --find-links /opt/violoop/wheels rknn3-toolkit-lite
